WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Narrator: Football crowds are meant to be lively - that's normal.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Narrator: What you're watching for is a change.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.900
Narrator: Sudden noise or sudden silence.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.800
Narrator: Many heads turning to one spot.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Narrator: A group forming.

6
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.200
Narrator: Raised voices, pointing, pushing - or people trying to get out.

7
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.600
Narrator: And remember: you only see what you look at.

8
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.400
Narrator: Keep scanning your whole area, not the match.

9
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:38.700
Narrator: If the mood turns tense, report early with facts.

